# object files, libraries, etc
*.[8qkv5967o]
# ...but the font subfonts are named for their code page, not for a
# compiler: fonts/lucm/latin1.9, fonts/pelm/latin1.8 and friends are
# source and were being ignored by the glob above purely because 9, 8
# and 5 are also objtype letters.  24 of them are tracked, so the ignore
# had no effect; it would have bitten whoever next removed and re-added
# one.
